SentinelX

SentinelX is an AI-powered document verification system developed for the Smart India Hackathon (SIH) project. It helps verify documents such as Aadhaar, PAN, and educational certificates using OCR and AI-based validation to detect mismatches and suspicious documents.

Features

- Document scan and upload
- OCR-based text extraction
- AI-powered verification
- Genuine or Suspicious result detection
- Simple and mobile-friendly interface

Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- OCR
- AI-based validation

Project Goal

To provide a fast, secure, and user-friendly document verification solution for citizens, organizations, and border security use cases.

Team

Developed by the SentinelX Team for Smart India Hackathon (SIH).
